cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GEARS in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "GEARS: Generating Electric vehicle recharging Sessions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Amara-Ouali"
    given-names: "Yvenn"
    affiliation: "EDF R&D"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EDF-Lab/GEARS"
url: "https://github.com/EDF-Lab/GEARS"
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
abstract: >-
  GEARS learns from charging-session records what a session looks like (when it starts, how long it
  lasts, how much energy it takes) and how many sessions a day to expect. It simulates new sessions,
  from a week to several years ahead, and tests smart-charging strategies on them.
keywords:
  - electric vehicles
  - charging sessions
  - simulation
  - Gaussian mixture model
  - smart charging
  - forecasting
